/** @mainpage stlab

Public API grouped by header (nested under directory modules where applicable).

@details
Source repository: [stlab/stlab on GitHub](https://github.com/stlab/stlab).

License: [Boost Software License 1.0](https://www.boost.org/LICENSE_1_0.txt).

Module overviews are listed under the Reference topics index (`algorithm`, `concurrency`, `forest`, and related headers).

Tasks, executors, timers, and process lifecycle are owned and documented by the public
dependency stlab-execution (currently unpublished). Its own README and standalone
Doxygen build document that API; no published execution documentation site is assumed.
Their canonical
include paths remain unchanged and are supplied transitively by `stlab::stlab`.
STLab retains futures, channels, await helpers, serial queues, and general utilities.
Independent configuration/version namespaces require rebuilding existing C++ clients;
source spellings and the v2 C execution ABI remain preserved.
 */
